---
layout: base.njk
title: "SEO Services for Small Businesses | GS Visibility"
description: "Technical SEO audits, on-page optimisation, local SEO and keyword research for small businesses in Europe and Australia. Four focused services."
---
{% from "breadcrumbs.njk" import crumbs %}
{{ crumbs([{name: "Home", url: "/"}, {name: "Services", url: "/services/"}], site.url) }}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "@id": "{{ site.url }}/services/#webpage",
  "url": "{{ site.url }}/services/",
  "name": {{ title | dump | safe }},
  "isPartOf": {"@id": "{{ site.url }}/#website"},
  "about": {"@id": "{{ site.url }}/#organization"},
  "inLanguage": "{{ site.locale }}"
}
</script>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>SEO services for small businesses</h1>
    <p class="lede">Four focused services rather than a bundled package. Pick what you need, or start with an audit to find out.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="service-hub-grid">
      {% for s in site.services %}
      <a class="service-hub-card" href="{{ s.url }}">
        <h2>{{ s.name }}</h2>
        <p>{{ s.blurb }}</p>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Not sure which service you need?</h2>
    <p>Start with a free mini-audit. We will look at your site and tell you where the biggest opportunity is.</p>
    <div class="contact-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-light" href="/contact/">Get a free mini-audit</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ site.whatsapp }}">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
